; The function words and the exceptions. Cards pass through except words: a word's letters (1-27) go onto this
; machine's own pile (OUT at keep; the pile goes round through INP gw / OUT kw and INP gy / OUT ky), counting n. At
; its end (-10) the word is looked for in the words deck, read through to its end (-99; dealt again for each word,
; INP at gd): the function words, each its letters and -52, then the exceptions, each its letters and -100 - its
; number, compared
; letter by letter with the word as the word goes round the pile once. Then the word goes on: its letters, -99, 1 if
; it is a function word (else 0), and -100 - its number in the exception list if it is one (else 0).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   w        03-19: a card: pass it on, a letter onto the pile, or a word's end
  04                    CLA   w
  05                    TAC   neg
  06                    SUB   c28
  07                    TAC   keep
  08            pass    OUT   w
  09                    JMP   rec
  10            neg     ADD   c10
  11                    TAC   pass
  12                    SUB   00
  13                    TAC   look
  14                    JMP   pass
  15            keep    OUT   w
  16                    CLA   n
  17                    ADD   00
  18                    STO   n
  19                    JMP   rec
  20            look    CLA   z        20-48: an entry, compared with the word
  21                    STO   fn
  22                    STO   k
  23            ent     CLA   z
  24                    STO   i
  25                    CLA   00
  26                    STO   m
  27            gd      INP   e
  28                    CLA   e
  29                    TAC   mk
  30                    CLA   n
  31                    SUB   i
  32                    SUB   00
  33                    TAC   mis
  34            cmp     CLA   i
  35                    ADD   00
  36                    STO   i
  37            gw      INP   w
  38            kw      OUT   w
  39                    CLA   w
  40                    SUB   e
  41                    TAC   mis
  42                    CLA   e
  43                    SUB   w
  44                    TAC   mis
  45                    JMP   gd
  46            mis     CLA   z
  47                    STO   m
  48                    JMP   gd
  49            mk      CLA   i        49-60: the entry's end: the rest of the word round the pile
  50                    SUB   n
  51                    TAC   cy
  52                    JMP   kind
  53            cy      CLA   z
  54                    STO   m
  55                    CLA   i
  56                    ADD   00
  57                    STO   i
  58            gy      INP   w
  59            ky      OUT   w
  60                    JMP   mk
  61            kind    CLA   e        61-69: a function word (-52), an exception (-100 - its number), or the end
  62                    ADD   c52
  63                    TAC   nf
  64                    CLA   fn
  65                    ADD   m
  66                    STO   fn
  67                    JMP   ent
  68            nf      ADD   c47
  69                    TAC   ex
  70            end     CLA   n        70-98: the word goes on
  71                    SUB   00
  72                    TAC   fin
  73                    STO   n
  74            gz      INP   w
  75                    OUT   w
  76                    JMP   end
  77            fin     OUT   e
  78                    OUT   fn
  79                    OUT   k
  80                    JMP   rec
  81            ex      CLA   m
  82                    SUB   00
  83                    TAC   ent
  84                    CLA   e
  85                    STO   k
  86                    JMP   ent
  87            n       DATA  0
  88            i       DATA  0
  89            m       DATA  0
  90            e       DATA  0
  91            w       DATA  0
  92            fn      DATA  0
  93            k       DATA  0
  94            z       DATA  0
  95            c10     DATA  10
  96            c28     DATA  28
  97            c52     DATA  52
  98            c47     DATA  47
